      "id": "claim_91ab80737afd4715aa24897c7132131c",
      "statement": "Brijio is a pnpm TypeScript monorepo (packageManager pnpm@10.32.1, engines.node >=22.0.0) whose pieces are servers/mcp (MCP server and the single brijio binary that starts the WebSocket server and MCP server together), servers/websocket (the relay that authenticates and routes between MCP and extensions), packages/shared (shared protocol and page-reading logic), clients/extensions/chrome and clients/extensions/safari (browser bridge using @brijio/shared), and clients/extensions/firefox (a planned, not implemented stub).",
